This rule is now implemented as the OpenCode `personal-coding-agent` skill. Load it at the start of any coding session. The full content lives in `~/.config/opencode/skills/personal-coding-agent/SKILL.md`.

Cursor-specific note: when a task requires the Firefox DevTools MCP, use `restart_firefox` with `firefoxPath: "/Applications/Firefox.app/Contents/MacOS/firefox"`. Never run `pkill -f firefox` without explicit user confirmation.